// ---------- the drill set ----------
//
// Every capital of the 54 UN member states of Africa, plus the country's
// economic centre wherever that is a different city. Multi-capital states
// (South Africa, Benin, Burundi, Côte d'Ivoire, Eswatini, Tanzania) contribute
// each seat. Suburbs of a capital's own metro — Serrekunda beside Banjul,
// Omdurman beside Khartoum, Lobamba beside Mbabane — are left out: at map
// scale they are the same dot.
//
// role is what the city IS, and doubles as the hint text.
